cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Manifoldscope in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Manifoldscope: exploring a single manifold as a geometric object"
abstract: >-
  A tool to explore a single manifold, whether any embedding output or an exported
  Vectorscope hidden-state cloud, treated as a geometric object in its own right. Part
  of the Vector Lab family of research instruments.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Berry
    given-names: David M.
    affiliation: University of Sussex
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7737-5586"
repository-code: "https://github.com/vector-lab-tools/manifoldscope"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
version: "0.5.1"
date-released: 2026-10-29
keywords:
  - embeddings
  - manifold
  - geometry
  - interpretability
  - vector space
